 # tags: rfd:feature
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2345) 'every tool in the workspace that writes a video file, first the decider-pong
 # tags: rfd:scope
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2345) 'interactor
 # tags: rfd:scope
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2345) 'Every rendered video is one format: CineForm and FLAC in Matroska.
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2345) 'The decider-pong recorders wrote H.264 and AAC in MP4. That is a lossy delivery format, and
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2345) 'a second encode loses more.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2345) 'Check a video with `ffprobe`, which must report `cfhd`, `gbrp12le`, 1920x1080 and the
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2345) '`matroska` format.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2345) 'The format, how fast it encodes, and how a file is checked
 # tags: rfd:details-title
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2345) 'Every rendered video is written as CineForm video and FLAC audio
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2345) 'in a Matroska (`.mkv`) file. CineForm runs at `gbrp12le`, so RGB frames
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2345) 'keep full chroma. MP4 is blocklisted as a container, and H.264 and AAC
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2345) 'are not written as outputs. A tool that writes video refuses an output
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2345) 'path that does not end in `.mkv`. Uncompressed PCM audio is accepted in
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2345) 'place of FLAC (operator, 2026-10-23); both are lossless.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

