2026-10-30T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2345) 'Why an intermediate
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2345) 'An intermediate must survive re-encoding and keep sharp synthetic edges.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2345) 'Encoder settings
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2345) 'The homebrew ffmpeg ships the `cfhd` encoder. It takes `yuv422p10le`,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2345) '`gbrp12le` and `gbrap12le`. The recorders use `gbrp12le`, because
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2345) 'their frames are RGB and Pong's edges are one colour against another.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2345) 'Audio is FLAC, or uncompressed PCM, at 48 kHz, stereo. An engine movie
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2345) 'writer receives 32-bit samples, so it writes `pcm_s24le` and never
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2345) '16-bit.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-2345) 'CineForm fails on a frame whose width is not divisible by 16 or whose
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-2345) 'height is not divisible by 8. A writer checks the size before it starts
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-2345) 'and refuses with a message that names the size, because the encoder
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-2345) 'otherwise dies mid-stream and the only symptom is a broken pipe.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:44Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-2345) 'A live recorder pipes raw RGB to one ffmpeg process that writes
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:46Z (RFD66606-2345) 'CineForm in Matroska, then a second pass copies that video and adds
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-2345) 'the FLAC track. Nothing is held in memory past the pipe.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-2345) 'Cost
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-2345) 'On the Mac mini, `cfhd` encodes a 1080p test source at about 170
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-2345) 'frames a second, so a 30 fps live render keeps up with room to spare.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-2345) 'A file grows by about 20 MB a second at 1080p. A 2-minute render is
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:53Z (RFD66606-2345) 'about 2.4 GB and a 5-minute render about 6 GB. The Desktop filled to
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:54Z (RFD66606-2345) '43 GB in one session, so superseded renders are listed for deletion
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:55Z (RFD66606-2345) 'and deleted only on request.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:56Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:57Z (RFD66606-2345) 'How a file is checked
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:58Z (RFD66606-2345) '`ffprobe` must report `cfhd`, `gbrp12le`, 1920x1080, `flac` or a
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:59Z (RFD66606-2345) '`pcm_s16le`/`pcm_s24le` stream at 48000 Hz
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:01:00Z (RFD66606-2345) 'and the `matroska` format, with the duration the run asked for. A
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:01:01Z (RFD66606-2345) 'frame is then pulled with `ffmpeg -ss` and looked at. That report and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:01:02Z (RFD66606-2345) 'that frame are the check, whatever exit code the recorder returns.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:01:03Z (RFD66606-2345) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

