 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:01:05Z (RFD66606-2345) '`recorder_second_opinion.py` exits with an error on any `--out` that
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:01:06Z (RFD66606-2345) 'does not end in `.mkv`. The planted control asked for
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:01:07Z (RFD66606-2345) '`planted.mp4`: the run exited 1 and wrote no file.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2345  1 LINE
 Text:Written

